{"title":"Gorgeous New Covers for Nabokov by Na Kim","link":"https://kottke.org/25/07/gorgeous-new-covers-for-nabokov-by-na-kim","date":1753384567000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nabokov-kim-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nabokov-kim-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nabokov-kim-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1542\" alt=\"book cover for Pale Fire by Vladimir Nabokov\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nabokov-kim-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nabokov-kim-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nabokov-kim-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1542\" alt=\"book cover for The Defense by Vladimir Nabokov\" /></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/na_son\">Na Kim</a> is one of the best book cover designers out there, and I love <a href=\"https://lithub.com/vladimir-nabokovs-entire-backlist-is-getting-a-brand-new-redesign/\">her set of covers</a> for four of Vladimir Nabokov’s books being released in advance of the 70th anniversary of Lolita. Pictured above are her covers for Pale Fire (<a href=\"https://bookshop.org/a/2966/9780679723424\">Bookshop</a>, <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0679723420/ref=nosim/0sil8\">Amazon</a>) and The Defense (<a href=\"https://bookshop.org/a/2966/9780679727224\">Bookshop</a>, <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0679727221/ref=nosim/0sil8\">Amazon</a>).</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/book%20covers\">book covers</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/books\">books</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Na%20Kim\">Na Kim</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Vladimir%20Nabokov\">Vladimir Nabokov</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/07/gorgeous-new-covers-for-nabokov-by-na-kim\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"506b46ae30e99fd7f61eba35d2cff4409fdd2739bf721c2d45da3a5eb77a6965","category":"Sites"}